    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: CRE21.5",
      "summary": "CRE21.5 refers to 'the tables above', but the chapter contains no preceding risk-weight table.",
      "impact": "Position: Supervisor maps an ECAI's long-term scale onto SA corporate weights. Reading a: Calibrate against CRE20 corporate/bank tables -> BBB = 100% (corporates) Reading b: Calibrate against 'tables above' in CRE21 -> only the short-term Table 15 is available, no long-term mapping Difference: not numeric; the target of the reference is undefined",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
